HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:43.730
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:51.310
Within each of our chests,

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.980
they begin to sprout

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.660
The seeds of the heart

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:56.950
are growing

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:59.580
bit by bit

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:00.250
Red,

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:00.860
white

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.170
and yellow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.870
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.330
all varied colors

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:07.810
that they

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:10.000
shine so brightly!

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:15.300
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:17.800
with such care

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:20.520
will never wither

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.140
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:27.020
Now, all together

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.480
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:32.150
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:37.090
They're always right by our sides

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:37.920
So together

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:41.700
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:44.710
bloom even more!

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:46.160
HeartCatch

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:47.710
