00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:22.080
Well, Tsubomi and I just need to go and...

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:24.060
Where are you two going?

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:26.710
It's dangerous to run off alone.

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:30.400
<i>Come on, just give us a chance to transform already!</i>

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:38.450
I guess the Precure must have turned tail and fled.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:55.200
Precure!

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.890
Open My Heart!

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:23.990
A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's light!

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:28.470
Cure Moonlight!

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.300
Let's all hide!

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:35.600
Okay!

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.290
Just like that, Desertrian!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.310
Destroy all in your path!

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:51.740
I'm sorry, but we really have to go and...

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:52.830
Stop that at once!

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:55.530
Hm?! Who's there?!

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:00.240
A silver Precure!

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:03.540
I'll never finish this movie in time.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.630
This stupid festival should just go away!

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:09.220
This is a scoop! A genuine scoop!

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:10.280
I wanna see too!

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:11.590
Hey, it's dangerous up there!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.890
Moviiie!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:32.150
Would you really not regret seeing the school festival disappear?

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:35.860
You should think about what it is you truly wish to achieve!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:37.530
Vie...

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:40.620
Tch. Seems like it's time to use this.

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:45.700
Sink into the darkness, and let your dark heart control you!

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:49.220
Dark Bracelet!

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:02.060
Now you'll be fighting me!

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:10.830
Are you two okay?!

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:14.170
Boss, Azusa! Hurry and get Kanae to the infirmary!

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:15.150
Quickly!

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:15.900
Right!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:40.670
My heart shall falter no longer

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.110
Gather, Floral Power!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.720
Moon Tact!

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:43.810
I'll pick myself up and keep moving forward

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:47.170
Knowing the tears I shed that fateful day

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:50.850
Have guided me back to where I am now

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:51.590
What was that just now?!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:54.200
The shard of the moon I thought lost

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:53.780
She moved so quickly.

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:56.690
Moonlight is so strong and pretty!

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:57.220
Slowly begins to return

00:18:57.100 --> 00:19:02.320
No matter how hard you fight, it doesn't change the fact that the Flower of his Heart is crumbling beyond repair!

00:18:57.220 --> 00:19:00.700
Let my courage grant me the strength

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:06.000
To bring forth the future we desire

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:05.350
You're wrong. I won't let it wilt!

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:09.400
I won't give up until every heart is filled with light!

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:12.350
The light of the silver moon

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:12.110
Flowers, shine forth!

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:15.670
Precure Silver Forte Wave!

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:15.670
Envelops even this sadness I feel

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:19.080
So let me use this power I've been granted

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:24.830
To bring light to the darkness

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:43.900
You're pretty good, Cure Moonlight.

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:53.970
H-Huh? Where's my film?

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:55.630
You mean this?

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:57.500
Thank goodness it's safe!

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:01.800
That's really important to you, isn't it?

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.970
Yeah, it's very precious to me.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:07.430
I really want to show it tomorrow at the festival!

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:10.390
I totally know how you feel!

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:15.400
Hey, Sugiyama!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.320
We need to work together and get this done!

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.980
Yeah, we have to get it done in time!

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:26.920
I want everyone to be able to enjoy our movie, after all!

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:29.490
Well then, I guess all's well that ends well.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:33.670
Wait, no it's not! We still haven't found anyone to work the lights for the fashion show!

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:35.330
Oh yeah...

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:37.350
Um...

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:39.050
I could do that if you like.

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:40.180
Huh?!

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:44.330
I'm pretty much free tomorrow, and I 
know my stuff when it comes to lighting.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.660
Th-Thank you so much!

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:49.940
All right!

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.600
In the language of flowers, a Chinese bellflower means "unyielding love."{Period inside quote.}

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:56.010
I'm glad he didn't lose his love for movies!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.650
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born.

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:16.020
With thish, the Great Heart Tree hash recovered a little more!{has -> hash}

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.960
Looks like we will get everything done in time after all!

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:22.890
Y-Yuri!

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:23.920
Huh?

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:27.540
It really suits you!

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:28.430
Yeah!

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:32.220
This really is a beautiful outfit.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:37.350
It took me forever to find a pair of shoes to match it.

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:43.530
Is that why you kept vanishing so early every day?

00:21:43.870 --> 00:21:48.990
Yes. You went through all the trouble of making this
 for me, so I had to make sure I got the shoes just right.

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:53.410
All right then! Let's give tomorrow's fashion show everything we've got!

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:54.870
Right!

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:09.430
The 53rd Myoudou Festival

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.980
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.190
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:32.660
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.800 --> 00:22:59.980
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:04.400
All those

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:09.000
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:14.240
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:16.910
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:21.130
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:27.260
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:31.300
With all our might!

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:34.640
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.810
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:44.730
<i>The school festival is now underway!</i>

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:46.900
<i>Your shtage awaitsh you!</i>

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:48.320
<i>I can't stop shaking.</i>

00:23:48.320 --> 00:23:50.780
<i>But what we really can't stop is our passion!</i>

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:53.320
<i>Let the girly, poppy fashion flow forth!</i>

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:55.160
<i>Are you all ready?</i>

00:23:55.160 --> 00:23:56.200
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:59.260
<i>Our fashion spirits are going into overdrive!</i>

